    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d734">

                <pb facs="0841" n="749" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg749"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.242/17</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bundy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-06-25T18:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 25, 1918, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>War Department will sell to Liberia arms and ammunition mentioned your May 1, 4
                        p.m.,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d734-f1"/> namely, 100 Krag Jorgensen carbines
                    and 250,000 rounds of ammunition. Awaits shipping directions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
